00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:28,360
-真的吗  -当然
-Really?  -Of course.

328
00:18:29,820 --> 00:18:33,660
听到了吗  斯图尔特  我有狗有教女  你屁都没有
You hear that, Stuart?! I've got a dog and a godchild, you have nothing!

329
00:18:40,750 --> 00:18:42,880
看这些小宝宝
Oh, look at all the babies!

330
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:45,790
有些会成为成功人士
Some will be successful,

331
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:47,380
有些可能会变成流浪汉
some may be homeless.

332
00:18:50,340 --> 00:18:51,880
想想就觉得有趣
It's fun to think about.

333
00:18:54,930 --> 00:18:56,470
不知道哪个是哈雷
I wonder which one's Halley.

334
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:58,180
很难看清楚名字
Kind of hard to see the names.

335
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:00,350
那个长的像伯纳黛特
Mm, that one kind of looks like Bernadette.

336
00:19:00,850 --> 00:19:02,190
我觉得都长一个样子
They all look the same to me.

337
00:19:02,650 --> 00:19:07,190
伙计们  她是我的教女  我觉得我看到她肯定能认出来
Guys,she's my goddaughter,I think I'll know when I see her.

338
00:19:17,790 --> 00:19:18,910
那个
That one.

339
00:19:26,170 --> 00:19:28,550
-好累的一天  -是的
-Well, that was quite a day.  -It was.

340
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:33,010
伯纳黛特生了孩子  我去了魔法世界
Bernadette had her baby,I made it to Wizarding World,

341
00:19:33,260 --> 00:19:36,550
现在是时候完成你的生日庆典了
and now it is time to complete your birthday celebration.

342
00:19:37,140 --> 00:19:38,970
听我所令  宽衣解带
Hankius pankius.

343
00:19:42,100 --> 00:19:44,060
我还担心你会太累呢
I was afraid you'd be too tired.

344
00:19:44,560 --> 00:19:47,560
艾米  我刚看到了魔法火车
Amy, I just saw a magic train

345
00:19:47,770 --> 00:19:50,190
还举报了有人插队
and reported somebody for cutting the line.

346
00:19:52,490 --> 00:19:54,780
如果这都不算前戏  那我不知道还能怎么戏了
If that's not foreplay, I don't know what is.

